msgid "Eid Mubarak"
msgstr "Eid Mubarak"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:189
msgid ""
"The Ledger with a night-blue-and-gold idle screen for Ramadan and Eid al-Fitr; the theme carries a soft accent and a greeting line into the order screens. Edit the greeting to make it yours."
msgstr ""
"Ledger med en nattblå og gyllen venteskjerm for ramadan og id al-fitr; temaet bruker en diskret aksentfarge og viser en hilsen på ordreskjermene. Rediger hilsenen slik at den blir din egen."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:203
msgid "Diwali"
msgstr "Diwali"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:205
msgid ""
"The Ledger with a warm idle screen of lights; the theme carries a soft accent and a greeting line into the order screens. Edit the greeting to make it yours."
msgstr ""
"Ledger med en varm venteskjerm dekorert med lys; temaet bruker en diskret aksentfarge og viser en hilsen på ordreskjermene. Rediger hilsenen slik at den blir din egen."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:219
